      "role": "user",
      "content": "The thing is, it's not just about the scripts. The new system actually strips out all the interactive decision-making and the nuanced persona layers you use to read the room. It literally just pipes text into a visual renderer. It's a much simpler architecture—no reasoning engine, no dynamic rapport building, just a visual placeholder. It's basically a complete reset of your current operational framework.",
